<title>USA: Presstek board sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Presstek board sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, N.H. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Presstek Inc said on Friday that its board has declared a two-for-one split of its common stock, to be effected with the issuance of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 7 to holders of common stock on June 12, it said.</p>
